{"articleNo":"466494","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=466494&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] [공사 안내] 글로벌관 옥상 국소배기장치 제어함 교체에 따른 주차구역 통제 및 실험실 흄후드 배기 사용 불가 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.10.30","hit":"6690","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b>◇ 공 사 안 내 ◇</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">글로벌관 실험실 환기 성능 개선을 위한 옥상 국소배기장치 제어반 교체 작업이 아래와&nbsp;같이 진행됨에 따라</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">공사기간 중&nbsp;<b><u><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">일부 주차구역이 통제</span></u></b>되고&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><u><b>실험실 흄후드 배기부분 사용이 제한</b></u></span>됨을 알려드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><br></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◎</span><span style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 14pt;\">공사기간 :&nbsp;<b>2023. 11. 04</b></span><span style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>.(토) ~ 05.(일)&nbsp; &lt;2일간&gt;</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ◎</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;공사문의 : 시설안전과 (☎ 478-7142)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.8;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.8;\"><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;①&nbsp;글로벌관·디지털관 사이 F구역 일부 주차 불가,&nbsp; &nbsp;② 글로벌관 북관 A구역 주차 및 도로 통행 불가</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmGYHoEYUgFAxgOwC4FMCCAjAhgT1wDkArTAewDEANfARwGkBLAOgAdkBzIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.8;\"><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
